    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">In order to continue to ensure good operation and insight about traffic on the contracting authority ́s websites, there is a need to implement a procurement of one tool for quality assurance and analysis of websites and websites. This tender contest is a new notice for "25/02531 Quality assurance and analysis of websites", which was cancelled. Minor changes have been made to this competition as regards the cancelled competition, including: Changes in scope/volume for NHN (Helsenorge).- Changes in scope/volume in option for NHN (nhn.no).- Typical analysis functions have been moved to a separate chapter in the requirement section. The specifications.- There have been some minor changes in the requirement text to clarify.- Requirement 2.1.10: the wording has been changed.- Two new B requirements have been added.- Set up for inserting the price offer have been somewhat changed.</cbc:Description>
